{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02616","headline":"田家三首 三 · 王绩","name":"田家三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生唯酒乐，作性不能无。\n朝朝访乡里，夜夜遣人酤。\n家贫留客久，不暇道精麤。\n抽帘持益炬，拔箦更燃炉。\n恒闻饮不足，何见有残壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}